SdStorageModeActivity (MasterROM): portable <-> adoptable SD card switch inside SecSettings.
Full screen page in the same One UI 8.5 glass design as the MasterROM Updater (colours, cards,
collapsing large title, pill buttons); every step, confirmations included, is a full screen page.
SdGlassBackground, SdAnimView illustrations, Secure Folder unlock step before moving files;
ResetGuard for factory reset.
src/  : Java source
smali/: compiled form that the build copies into SecSettings (new smali_classesN dir).
Rebuild: run the "SD storage page (Java -> smali)" workflow (.github/workflows/sdstorage.yml).
         It compiles SdStorageModeActivity, SdAnimView, SdGlassBackground and SdGlyphView against
         a framework jar with hidden APIs (javac -> d8 -> apktool) and commits the smali.
         ResetGuard and SdStoragePreferenceController need SecSettings classes and are not rebuilt.
